Android Timer Clock Program (Kotlin)
AIM:
To create a simple Timer Clock application in Android that displays a countdown timer.
Algorithm
1.	Start the Android application. 
2.	Create a TextView to display the timer value. 
3.	Create a Button to start the timer. 
4.	Initialize the timer with a specified duration (e.g., 30 seconds). 
5.	When the Start button is clicked, begin the countdown. 
6.	Update the TextView every second. 
7.	When the timer reaches zero, display "Time Up!". 
8.	Stop the application. 
